I was happy to hear it.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:06.910
I'm sure everyone was.

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:26.620
When did I start feeling this way?

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.910
I used to think, "I like being here."

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:44.580
Not anymore. It's different.

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:59.540
Now I think, "I want to stay here."

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:11.330
It's where my friends are...
It's where I call home...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:18.410
I love it here. I love these people.

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:21.580
I want to fight beside them...

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.120
...and live.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:43.370
This place... These people
are my reason for fighting, Odin.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:54.330
Should've left while
I had the chance. Oh well.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.620
People still cry at her age?

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:02.200
They sure do, kiddo.
You telling me you can't see she's just a kid?

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:06.450
To be honest, I've wanted
to think that wasn't the case.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:08.790
Damn, I'm hopeless.

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:11.660
Good thing I caught on though.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:16.160
Feels like I could do anything for those tears.

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:18.790
Sounds like we're gonna have fun.

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:22.790
Nothing wrong with that. It's good to have fun.

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:29.950
We've gotta be true to our base.

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:32.950
Let's be happy and have some fun!

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:00.450
