--Nice yukatas!
--Nice final episode!

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:02.160
It ain't the final episode!

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:05.040
That's right! Our journey isn't over yet!

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:06.790
